 Wang","target":"Eddie Wang","line":5},{"title":"![Complete guide to migrating CI/CD pipelines from Jenkins to GitHub Actions","target":"https://assets.blog.tenki.cloud/Jenkins%20to%20GitHub%20Actions%20Migration%20Guide.png","line":216},{"title":"GitHub Actions","target":"https://tenki.cloud/blog/jenkins-github-actions-migration","line":218},{"title":"·Jun 2026\n\nJenkins to GitHub Actions Migration Guide\n\nEddie Wang\n\n","target":"https://tenki.cloud/blog/jenkins-github-actions-migration","line":220},{"title":"![Guide to migrating GitHub Actions to Node.js 24 before the deprecation deadline","target":"https://assets.blog.tenki.cloud/Migrate%20GitHub%20Actions%20to%20Nodejs%2024%20Before%20the%20Deadline.png","line":226},{"title":"![GitHub Actions runner images 2026 - complete guide to selecting the right runner for your workflows","target":"https://assets.blog.tenki.cloud/GitHub%20Actions%20Runner%20Images%20in%202026%20The%20Complete%20Selection%20Guide.png","line":236}],"metadata":{"title":"GitHub Merge Queue in 2026: How It Works & Handling Flaky Required Status Checks","source":"https://tenki.cloud/blog/github-merge-queue-setup","author":["[[Eddie Wang]]"],"published":"2026-02-25","created":"2026-06-30","description":"GitHub's merge queue prevents broken merges on busy branches, but common gaps trip up most teams who enable it. Here's how the queue actually works, how to configure it properly, and how to stop flaky tests from blocking your entire pipeline.","tags":["#github-actions","#ci-cd","#merge-queue"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[[53,68],[86,116],[117,132],[146,153]]},